      "initialText": "Field Kiln\nObjects for the everyday\nA fictional ceramics shop\nChoose your teapot ↗\nThe collection / Teaware / Everyday Teapot\nFIELD NOTES\n01 / TEAWARE\nEveryday Teapot · Iron glaze shown\n650 ml\n\nOriginal vector illustration of a fictional sample product; not a photograph. Illustration shows Iron; Sand has no separate illustration.\n\nStoneware, simply.\n\nA familiar shape.\nA place in your daily ritual.\n\nHANDMADE CERAMICS / NO. 01\n\nEveryday\nTeapot\n$68 USD / piece\nGlazed stoneware\n\nA handmade stoneware teapot for the small ritual of making tea. A rounded form, a curved handle, and room for 650 ml.\n\n01 Choose a glaze\nIron\n4 in stock\nAsh\nUnavailable\nSand\n7 in stock\n02 Quantity\n1 piece\n2 pieces\n3 pieces\n4 pieces\nPieces 1 × $68\n$68\nDomestic shipping\n$8\nTotal USD\n$76\nAdd to simulated cart\n↗\n\nA local cart demonstration. No payment or order is placed.\n\nDelivery\n\nDispatch in 2 business days; illustrative domestic transit 3–5 business days.\n\nReturns\n\nUnused pieces accepted within 30 days. Customer pays return shipping; original shipping is nonrefundable.\n\nKNOW YOUR PIECE\n\nMade for tea.\nCare for it simply.\nMaterial\nGlazed stoneware\nDimensions\n16 cm wide × 12 cm high\nCapacity\n650 ml\nCare\nHand wash. Avoid sudden temperature changes. Not for stovetop use.\nField Kiln\n\nFictional shop and illustrative product, price, stock, delivery, and returns.\n\nBack to the piece ↑",
